    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107883" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτέλ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beyond completeness</i> or <i>perfection,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλοὶ ὑ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρεῖοι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.81
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Fr.Hist.</u>
				67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of numbers, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτελής</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1
			</span></i>, Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.45
			</span></i> H.</div>
